#. module: odossey_timesheet_to_invoice_noise
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:odossey_timesheet_to_invoice_noise.field_res_company__timesheet_noise_minutes
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:odossey_timesheet_to_invoice_noise.field_res_config_settings__timesheet_noise_minutes
msgid ""
"Maximum number of minutes added to or removed from each timesheet in the '+ Hours' reports of quotations and invoices. The variations of a sales order line always add up to zero, so the totals and the amounts do not change.\n"
"Example with 5: entries of 00:30, 00:15 and 01:00 can be printed as 00:33, 00:11 and 01:01 (total 01:45 in both cases).\n"
"Set 0 to print the hours exactly as recorded."
msgstr ""
"Numero massimo di minuti aggiunti o tolti a ogni registrazione ore nei report '+ Ore' di preventivi e fatture. Le variazioni di una riga d'ordine sommano sempre zero, quindi i totali e gli importi non cambiano.\n"
"Esempio con 5: registrazioni di 00:30, 00:15 e 01:00 possono essere stampate come 00:33, 00:11 e 01:01 (totale 01:45 in entrambi i casi).\n"
"Impostare 0 per stampare le ore esattamente come registrate."

#. module: odossey_timesheet_to_invoice_noise
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:odossey_timesheet_to_invoice_noise.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Minutes added to or removed from each timesheet in the '+ Hours' reports. "
"The variations of a sales order line add up to zero: totals and amounts do "
"not change. Example with 5: 00:30, 00:15 and 01:00 printed as 00:33, 00:11 "
"and 01:01. Set 0 to print the recorded hours."
msgstr ""
"Minuti aggiunti o tolti a ogni registrazione ore nei report '+ Ore'. Le "
"variazioni di una riga d'ordine sommano zero: totali e importi non cambiano."
" Esempio con 5: 00:30, 00:15 e 01:00 stampati come 00:33, 00:11 e 01:01. "
"Impostare 0 per stampare le ore registrate."

